I saw a dog in my dream. A cat, too.
I was in my parent's house, taking a shower, and when I look back there was a dog. A strange dog, but I felt like I knew him. I said お風呂に来ちゃだめだよ、濡れちゃうよ。 and stopped the shower, I rested myself in a bathtub, having the dog there still, petting him. It was a warm day with a warm light filling the world, around 10 am, the smell of a shower room, the world seemed to have rebirthed last night, and I loved him, loved the dog. Being clingy, he was delighted.
He wanted to have tattooed, so we went to a tattoo shop that day, had him tattooed, what king of tattoo I don't remember.
I met a cat too in the same dream, on a different day. Also a strange one but felt like I knew him. I loved him, dearly too, and he me too, had a good time.
But I never saw them again. They were not my dog, my cat. I don't know where they went. But they went.
Getting awake, the dream lingering in my head, and I thought it may be a good idea to have a dog or a cat. Every mornig I wake up early to run, so it should be nice to run with them. Thinking of things like that, I stayed seated on my bed, as the feeling of love stayed in my mind.
This morning, I couldn't wake up early because I had a cold, thus could not run, but thanks to that I met a dog and a cat. That was what I was given for that.
